{"title":"*Marked by Time*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/927473429/0/marginalrevolution~Marked-by-Time.html","date":1762804454000,"content":"<p>The author is Robert J, Sampson, and the subtitle is<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Marked-Time-Transformed-Trajectories-Americans/dp/0674987543/ref=sr_1_1?crid=11W8AU10FSL0D&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.Qh2ziEPIk1_Nk1aHRbo7DQ._z5ohGoSJ2tAlPZu0ZyQhHlN1RKiewyb-n_-go0BSzI&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=marked+by+time+by+robert+j.+sampson&amp;qid=1762613663&amp;sprefix=marked+by+time%2Caps%2C124&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\"> How Social Change has Transformed Crime and the Life Trajectories of Young Americans</a>, from Harvard University Press.  Excerpt:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>…[for part of Chicago]..the chance of being arrested in life among people born in the mid-1980s is more than double that of those born just a decade later, in the mid-1990s.  This large arrest inequality does not arise from early-life individual, family, or local neighborhood characteristics.  It arises from the larger and highly divergent socio-historical contexts in which the children grew through adolescence into adulthood.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>The particular story focuses on guns, death, and lead exposure, though I wonder whether the in-sample implied elasticities are validated out of sample.  Nonetheless an interesting book.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/marked-by-time.html\">*Marked by Time*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/927473429/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/927473429/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/927473429/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/927473429/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/927473429/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/927473429/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/marked-by-time.html#respond\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/marked-by-time.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a><h3>Related Stories</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/my-conversation-with-the-excellent-jonny-steinberg.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=my-conversation-with-the-excellent-jonny-steinberg\">My Conversation with the excellent Jonny Steinberg</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/11/the-mr-podcast-our-favorite-models-session-3-compensating-differentials-and-selective-incentives.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=the-mr-podcast-our-favorite-models-session-3-compensating-differentials-and-selective-incentives\">The MR Podcast: Our Favorite Models, Session 3: Compensating Differentials and Selective Incentives</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/the-master-of-contradictions.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=the-master-of-contradictions\">*The Master of Contradictions*</a></li></ul> </div>","author":"Tyler Cowen","siteTitle":"Marginal Revolution","siteHash":"242a3a39129b36e0c574c3796ca7ef3cf8af967286c2998fabf7240d1ad52a47","entryHash":"270878175993114d4d907d2fc647c92a1fac8afebe3d8a4df1370c33c7039b8d","category":"Sites"}